  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nLa Mer brings warmth and softness to images while retaining the natural character of the scene. It gently enriches skin tones and balances cooler colors, creating a relaxed, understated finish. Suited to outdoor portraits, travel, and lifestyle imagery, it works in both bright and overcast conditions. Use it to temper harsh light, add warmth in cool or gray conditions, or give everyday images a subtle sense of nostalgia.",
